# Provide a Test Link When Ready

When local testing passes (Playwright, serve_local, etc.) and the change is ready for the user to try:

1. **Start the local server** if not already running (`python tools/serve_local.py` on port 5173).
2. **Give the user a clickable localhost link** to the specific page that changed, e.g.:
   - `http://localhost:5173/vr/game-arena/fps-v5/index.html`
   - `http://localhost:5173/index.html`
   - `http://localhost:5173/fc/` (FavCreators)
3. **After deploy**, also give the **live site link**, e.g.:
   - `https://findtorontoevents.ca/vr/game-arena/fps-v5/index.html`

Do **not** just say "tests passed" and stop. Always hand the user a link so they can verify in their own browser.
